  m_Name: lore_l6_cleaners
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: RootAccess.Systems::RootAccess.Systems.LoreDefinition
  loreId: lore_l6_cleaners
  title: "Jurnal: echipa de sp\u0103lat geamuri"
  body: "Nacela 2 merge singur\u0103 de la o vreme, dus-\xEEntors, f\u0103r\u0103
    s\u0103-i spun\u0103 nimeni. Grilajele de pe pasarela de est sunt ruginite p\xE2n\u0103
    la os. Halden a promis c\u0103 le schimb\u0103 trimestrul viitor. Asta a fost
    acum trei ani."
  titleEn: 'Log: window-cleaning crew'
  bodyEn: Gondola 2 has been running on its own for a while, back and forth, with
    nobody telling it to. The grates on the east catwalk are rusted to the bone.
    Halden promised to replace them next quarter. That was three years ago.
  levelId: level06
  order: 15
